														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2126809">
									

<p>I really like this, but I can see two different interpretations, and I wanna know which is closer to the truth&#8230;</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+Just&nbsp;guessin'</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>Either the Society for Advanced Human Research is genuinely continuing to undertake these horrifying tests, and the infectious technical documentation is just a side effect of whatever they unleashed after the war, or&#8230;</p>
<p>They created this as a condemnation of US treatment of Unit 731, and made it a pretty damn tenacious condemnation at that.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>

