<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>(and I love how it played out in the Apocalypse Codex).</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p>Mind you, as much as I can complain, I love these books and Stross is one of my favorite authors. I like the Jennifer Morgue and the Fuller Memorandum best so far.</p>
