<br />
I haven't read Rhesus Chart yet :( It isn't out in paperback for a while, and it was like $15 for a while on Kindle I think. I really need to bite the bullet and buy it.
<p>(I'm enough of a nerd that I used to get relatives in the UK to ship me trade paperbacks, which came out there before our hardcovers do. No luck on this one, though.)</p>

