<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-827120-2"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-827120-2')">2</a>. Similarity between the vectors of transmission, and contagious nature of SCP-2177, <a href="/scp-1866">SCP-1866</a>, and <a href="/scp-2976">SCP-2976</a> has been noted. Investigation into a potential shared origin for these phenomena is ongoing.</div>
</div>

